**Faithful web→native parity** (no Tailwind ported; P1/S9 tokens only):
- Controlled WAI-ARIA tablist over a `Binding<String>` (web `activeTab`+`onChange`)
- Roving `@FocusState` + `.onKeyPress(.leftArrow/.rightArrow/.home/.end)` → pure, tested `TabsKeyboardNavigation` (Left/Right wrap, Home/End, disabled-skip, empty/orphan no-op)
- `useId` id scheme, selected accent underline (web `border-b-2`), hover/disabled styling
- Every state renders real chrome: tablist, **empty** (web maps over `[]`), loading skeleton, error+retry, Live/Stale/Offline freshness
- P1/S10 i18n facade (no English literals), P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry, VoiceOver traits/labels, Dynamic Type + reduce-motion

